ished ACE panel, including [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]first-class navigation across #[...] calls and backlinks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]snippets_panel.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/snippets_panel.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-rd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-rd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust snippet relation and validation contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-relations[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-relations: extend the shared Rust snippet composer with validated [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]trigger, relation, alias, and diagnostic metadata.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Project-aware snippet catalog and mutation service[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog-mutations[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-relations[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog-mutations: build one provenance-aware Python service for catalog[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reads and conflict-safe config snippet writes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase snippet command group[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]snippet-cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog-mutations[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]snippet-cli: expose add, delete, list, and show with rich and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machine-readable output over the shared service.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #